WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:02.800
This is an important message from the U.S.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.440
Department of Health and Human Services.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.920
As the cleanup process begins after a natural disaster,

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.800
there may be areas of flooding.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.220
Constantly watch your children to prevent playing in or

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:16.080
around water. It doesn't take long and it doesn't

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.380
take much water for young children to drown.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.320
In many cases, children who drowned had been out

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.660
of sight less than five minutes and were in

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.700
the care of one or both parents at the

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.960
time. To learn more, call the CDC at 1

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.120
-800-CDC-INFO.
